{%- comment -%}
  ===========================================================================
  REVIEWS BLOCK — paste into a "Custom Liquid" section in Shopify.
  Centred headline and a stack of review cards: stars, quote, then avatar,
  name and meta line. Self-contained, styles scoped under .prv, sizes scale
  off the container.

  EDIT ME: the captures below. Everything else is layout.
  ===========================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Headline: the second part is the coloured italic word. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture title_lead -%}
  What Parents Are
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture title_accent -%}
  Saying
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  # Shown after each reviewer's meta line. Clear it to drop the badge.
  assign verified_label = 'Verified buyer'
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  ---------- REVIEWS ----------
  quote ~~ name ~~ meta ~~ avatar image URL      (reviews separated by || )

  Avatars: upload each photo in Shopify admin → Settings → Files, copy the
  URL and paste it as the 4th field. Leave it empty for an initial circle.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture review_data -%}
