  the answer. He went straight to this book, found it, and spent 45 minutes reading
  about vision, brains and evolution. He came back and explained it to me. I almost
  cried. His teacher called two weeks later to say he was the most engaged student in
  class.
  ~~ Rachel M. ~~ Mom of two · Texas ~~
  ||
  I was skeptical. My son doesn't read. He's a screen kid. I put this on the coffee
  table and didn't say a word. Day 3, I found him on the floor reading about black
  holes at 9pm when I thought he was asleep. He's read it cover to cover twice. That
  is not a normal thing for him. Buy it — it competes with screens and wins.
  ~~ David K. ~~ Father of one · California ~~
  ||
  Bought 3 copies — one for each of my kids and one for my nephew's birthday. The
  dinner table conversations we've had because of this book are priceless. My
  7-year-old explained tectonic plates to my mother-in-law. She was completely
  speechless. This book changes how kids think, not just what they know.
  ~~ Sarah J. ~~ Mom of three · Arizona ~~
  ||
  My daughter has never once picked up a book without being forced. I left this on the
  coffee table on a Friday. By Sunday she had read half of it and was explaining to her
  grandfather why the moon doesn't fall out of the sky. He's a retired engineer. He was
  impressed. I was speechless. This book is something else entirely.
  ~~ Lisa W. ~~ Mom of two · Ohio ~~
  ||
  Bought this for my grandson's birthday not knowing what to expect. He opened it,
  looked at the cover for about thirty seconds, and said 'is this actually mine?' He
  read it at his own party. His mum called me two months later to say he'd read it
  three times and was asking if there was a second one. Best gift I've given in years.
  ~~ Margaret T. ~~ Grandmother of four · Illinois ~~
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign review_rows = review_data | split: '||' -%}

<div class="prv">
  <div class="prv__inner">

    <h2 class="prv__title">
      {{ title_lead | strip }}
      <span class="prv__accent">{{ title_accent | strip }}</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="prv__list">
      {%- for row in review_rows -%}
        {%- assign f = row | split: '~~' -%}
        {%- assign r_quote  = f[0] | strip -%}
        {%- assign r_name   = f[1] | strip -%}
        {%- assign r_meta   = f[2] | strip -%}
        {%- assign r_avatar = f[3] | strip -%}
        <figure class="prv__card">
          <span class="prv__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
          <blockquote class="prv__quote">&ldquo;{{ r_quote }}&rdquo;</blockquote>

          <figcaption class="prv__who">
            {%- if r_avatar != blank -%}
              <img class="prv__avatar" src="{{ r_avatar }}" alt="{{ r_name }}"
                   width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="prv__avatar prv__avatar--initial" aria-hidden="true">
                {{ r_name | slice: 0 }}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="prv__meta">
              <span class="prv__name">{{ r_name }}</span>
              <span class="prv__sub">
                {{ r_meta }}
                {%- if verified_label != blank -%}
                  <span class="prv__sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span class="prv__verified">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="11" height="11" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M3.5 10.5l4 4 9-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"
                            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                    {{ verified_label }}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .prv {
    /* ---- TWEAK THE LOOK HERE ---- */
    --prv-bg:       transparent; /* section surface           */
    --prv-ink:      #101a35;     /* headline + names          */
    --prv-quote:    #1d2740;     /* quote text                */
    --prv-muted:    #8a93a5;     /* meta line                 */
    --prv-accent:   #b23a29;     /* italic word in the title  */
    --prv-green:    #1a7f4b;     /* verified badge            */
    --prv-star:     #f0a92c;
    --prv-card:     #ffffff;     /* card fill                 */
    --prv-card-br:  #eef1f5;     /* card hairline + divider   */
    --prv-max:      900px;       /* content width             */

    --prv-pad-x:    clamp(0px, 2.2cqi, 24px);
    --prv-pad-y:    clamp(24px, 4cqi, 56px);

    /* sizes scale off this box, not the viewport */
    container-type: inline-size;

    background: var(--prv-bg);
    color: var(--prv-ink);
    font-family: inherit;
    padding: 32px 16px;
    padding: var(--prv-pad-y) var(--prv-pad-x);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .prv *,
  .prv *::before,
  .prv *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* Themes style bare elements — :where() keeps these at zero specificity
     so the component rules below always win. */
  .prv :where(h2, p) { margin: 0; }
  .prv :where(figure, figcaption, blockquote) {
    margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; quotes: none;
  }
  .prv :where(blockquote)::before,
  .prv :where(blockquote)::after { content: none; }
  .prv :where(img) { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }

  .prv__inner {
    max-width: var(--prv-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .prv__title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 4.4cqi, 40px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--prv-ink);
  }
  .prv__accent {
    color: var(--prv-accent);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ---------- cards ---------- */
  .prv__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(12px, 1.8cqi, 20px);
    margin-top: clamp(18px, 3cqi, 34px);
  }
  .prv__card {
    background: var(--prv-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--prv-card-br);
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(16, 26, 53, .06);
    padding: clamp(20px, 3cqi, 34px);
  }
  .prv__stars {
    display: block;
    color: var(--prv-star);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.9cqi, 20px);
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .prv__quote {
    margin-top: clamp(12px, 1.8cqi, 20px);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.9cqi, 18px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--prv-quote);
  }

  /* ---------- attribution ---------- */
  .prv__who {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(10px, 1.4cqi, 15px);
    margin-top: clamp(16px, 2.4cqi, 26px);
    padding-top: clamp(14px, 2.2cqi, 24px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--prv-card-br);
  }
  .prv__avatar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 40px;  height: 40px;
    width: clamp(38px, 4.6cqi, 50px);
    height: clamp(38px, 4.6cqi, 50px);
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #eef1f5;
  }
  .prv__avatar--initial {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 2cqi, 20px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--prv-ink);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .prv__meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
  .prv__name {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.65cqi, 17px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--prv-ink);
  }
  .prv__sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-size: clamp(12.5px, 1.45cqi, 15px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--prv-muted);
  }
  .prv__verified {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    color: var(--prv-green);
    font-weight: 800;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
